{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj55wyJA1qLLaVyUwNV3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient wooden door stands before you, weathered and silent. A single iron keyhole glints dully in its center.*\n\n*You insert the key.*\n\n*A deep, resonant CLICK echoes through the chamber. Tumblers turn — one, two, three — mechanisms older than memory grinding to life. Dust falls from the frame like shed years.*\n\n*The door groans inward, slowly, heavily, revealing:*\n\n───────────────────────\n│                                                          │\n│         A corridor of pale golden light.          │\n│     The air tastes of rain and old stone.        │\n│  Somewhere ahead, water drips in steady         │\n│        rhythm, counting something                    │\n│              you cannot name.                            │\n│                                                          │\n│      The floor is worn smooth by                     │\n│          ten thousand crossings                        │\n│        before yours.                                      │\n│                                                          │\n│                You may enter.                            │\n│                                                          │\n───────────────────────\n\n*The door holds itself open and waits.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":254,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}